  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><article class=\"pb-12 md:pb-20\"><header class=\"bg-off-white\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 container mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center px-4 pb-8 lg:pb-0 lg:px-0 lg:pr-12 order-last lg:order-first\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-6xl\">The Manual Icon Collection</h1><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"inline-block text-sm px-3 py-1 border border-black rounded-full\">Collections</span></div><span class=\"text-neutral-500 block mt-6\">Sick and tired of most cars being produced with automatic gearboxes? Don't fret! Bidders Highway presents a small collection of sports cars under the name The Manual Icons. You will find five classic sportscar, all packing manual gearboxes and fabulous driving experiences.</span><div class=\"flex mt-6\"><div class=\"mr-2\"><a href=\"/en/authors/bidders-highway\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-full w-[48px]\" src=\"/assets/bidders-highway-63938c17.jpg\"></a></div><div><a href=\"/en/authors/bidders-highway\" class=\"block hover:underline\">Bidders Highway</a><span class=\"block text-neutral-500 text-sm\">December 20, 2023 15:00</span></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-8 lg:mb-0\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/89492cc2def5cbbb2bc259abefc68fc9\" width=\"1220\" height=\"840\"></div></div></header><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10 my-8 lg:my-12\"><div class=\"xl:w-2/3 auction-body\"><div>Before the introduction of the automatic transmission into car manufacturing, all&nbsp; cars were manual. With today's development, more and more cars are equipped&nbsp; with automatic transmissions and the choices of a cars with a manual&nbsp; transmission is becoming fewer. The team at Bidders Highway have been&nbsp; honoured to help auction off a collection of iconic manual transmission sports cars.<br><br>First up is a completely renovated Plymouth Cuda in absolute mint condition. We&nbsp; dare say that it is almost in better condition today than when it rolled off the&nbsp; assembly line in 1972. The Cuda has not been driven more than 37km since the&nbsp; restoration was completed. For those who like domestic, albeit imported, there is&nbsp; a Volvo P1800S in an as nicely restored condition as the Cuda.<br><br><br>If you lean more towards Anglophile, we can offer two real treats! One is a&nbsp; fantastic bright yellow Lotus Esprit Turbo SE from 1989. The car is sold in Sweden and has driven just under 43500 kilometres. An excellent opportunity for those&nbsp; who prefer something different. If you prefer a higher number of cylinders and&nbsp; the wind in your hair, a Jaguar E-Type 4.2 Roadster is included in the collection.&nbsp; The car is from 1970 and comes in good used condition.<br><br><br>Last but not least, it includes a Porsche 930 Turbo from 1978, built for really fast&nbsp; pacing. With a peak power of approx. 600hp, built from the best parts and&nbsp; developed over many years, there is potential for the great driver to set quick&nbsp; lap times at this summer's track meets and competitions.<br><br>All the above-mentioned cars thus come with manual gearboxes, perfect for the&nbsp; enthusiast looking for great driving experiences.</div></div><div class=\"xl:w-2/3 mt-10 lg:mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">0 Comments</h2><div class=\"mb-16\"><span class=\"block border bg-rose-50 text-neutral-600 p-4 my-4 rounded\">You need to be signed in in order to post comments.</span><ul id=\"comments\"></ul></div></div></div></article><div class=\"bg-black text-white py-10 spotlight-theme\" style=\"\n      background-image: linear-gradient(to top, #000, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)),\n                        linear-gradient(to right, #000, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)),\n                        url('https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/89492cc2def5cbbb2bc259abefc68fc9');\n    \"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 \"><h3 class=\"text-neutral-400\">The collection</h3><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight max-w-lg mb-4\"><a href=\"/en/themes/the-manual-icon-collection\" class=\"hover:text-jaffa transition-colors\">The Manual Icon Collection</a></h2><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-lg mb-7\">Sick and tired of most cars being produced with automatic gearboxes? Don't fret! Bidders Highway presents a small collection of sports cars under the name The Manual Icons. You will find five classic sportscar, all packing manual gearboxes and fabulous driving experiences.</p><div class=\"flex items-center font-medium gap-6\"><a href=\"/en/themes/the-manual-icon-collection\" class=\"inline-block rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors px-4 py-2 text-white bg-jaffa hover:bg-zest disabled:bg-yellow-700 disabled:text-neutral-300\">View collection</a><a href=\"/en/posts/the-manual-icon-collection-en\" class=\"text-jaffa hover:text-zest\">Read the article</a></div><div class=\"mt-12\"><h3 class=\"font-serif uppercase text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-racing-700 text-white pb-4\"><a href=\"/en/themes/the-manual-icon-collection\" class=\"hover:text-jaffa transition-colors\">Discover</a></h3><style>\n        #theme_84602380-6ba6-43f7-af57-da6e4b8ebd8c { width: max(100%, 220%); }\n        @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {\n          #theme_84602380-6ba6-43f7-af57-da6e4b8ebd8c { width: max(100%, 90%); }\n        }\n      </style><div class=\"w-full overflow-x-auto snap-x\"><ul id=\"theme_84602380-6ba6-43f7-af57-da6e4b8ebd8c\" class=\"flex gap-2 lg:gap-4\"><li class=\"w-1/2 lg:w-1/5 snap-start\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio: 82/56;\" class=\"relative\"><a href=\"/en/auctions/plymouth-cuda-340\" class=\"hover:opacity-90 transition-all\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/9218f832e8d8968790abf83f841f6933\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"1972 Plymouth Cuda 340 MNX10G\" width=\"820\" height=\"560\"></a><h4 class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mb-0 pb-2 h-1/2 text-sm w-full px-2 flex items-end pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80\">1972 Plymouth Cuda 340</h4></div></li><li class=\"w-1/2 lg:w-1/5 snap-start\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio: 82/56;\" class=\"relative\"><a href=\"/en/auctions/volvo-p1800-s-HCL77U\" class=\"hover:opacity-90 transition-all\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/59fdca2e63ff223e152725802d07f5e5\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"1963 Volvo P1800 S HCL77U\" width=\"820\" height=\"560\"></a><h4 class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mb-0 pb-2 h-1/2 text-sm w-full px-2 flex items-end pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80\">1963 Volvo P1800 S</h4></div></li><li class=\"w-1/2 lg:w-1/5 snap-start\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio: 82/56;\" class=\"relative\"><a href=\"/en/auctions/jaguar-e-type-roadster\" class=\"hover:opacity-90 transition-all\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/78afc93520e7cfead08637d178f82b2a\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"1970 Jaguar E-Type Roadster PCL078\" width=\"820\" height=\"560\"></a><h4 class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mb-0 pb-2 h-1/2 text-sm w-full px-2 flex items-end pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80\">1970 Jaguar E-Type Roadster</h4></div></li><li class=\"w-1/2 lg:w-1/5 snap-start\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio: 82/56;\" class=\"relative\"><a href=\"/en/auctions/lotus-esprit-turbo-se\" class=\"hover:opacity-90 transition-all\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/3d39906f389dc0f269ba37ff5f996e99\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"1989 Lotus Esprit Turbo SE OGX200\" width=\"820\" height=\"560\"></a><h4 class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mb-0 pb-2 h-1/2 text-sm w-full px-2 flex items-end pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80\">1989 Lotus Esprit Turbo SE</h4></div></li><li class=\"w-1/2 lg:w-1/5 snap-start\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio: 82/56;\" class=\"relative\"><a href=\"/en/auctions/porsche-911-930-turbo\" class=\"hover:opacity-90 transition-all\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/2c71837f628e51e25a01e97d27d6cdb2\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"1978 Porsche 911 930 Turbo EAY682\" width=\"820\" height=\"560\"></a><h4 class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mb-0 pb-2 h-1/2 text-sm w-full px-2 flex items-end pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80\">1978 Porsche 911 930 Turbo</h4></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center py-8\"><a href=\"/en\" class=\"inline-block rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors px-4 py-2 text-white bg-jaffa hover:bg-zest disabled:bg-yellow-700 disabled:text-neutral-300 px-6 py-3\">View all our car auctions</a></div></main>",
